   436	<h2 id="golden"><span class="num">8</span>金标：改提示词的测试标准</h2>
   437	<p>按这一页从原文逐篇写的参照，用来量提示词改动。Alex 的要求是"以上有你自己trace 过的golden set 来做为改prompt测试标准"<span class="src">D241</span>。定稿文件：<span class="path">docs/research/2026-10-29-ledger-standard/golden-v3/golden-v3-signed.json</span>，sha256 <code>78844bc329fc85000e18ddcab9ea59feb57abe6407cf11bbead4ba8fe4c3c0d3</code><span class="src">D243</span>。</p>
   438	<div class="tiles">
   439	<div class="tile"><div class="v">118</div><div class="l">篇测试文章：那一周 98 篇，留出 20 篇</div></div>
   440	<div class="tile"><div class="v">348</div><div class="l">条要收或可以收的证据，一件事一条</div></div>
   441	<div class="tile"><div class="v">738</div><div class="l">句不收，各写理由；另有 24 句可选</div></div>
   442	<div class="tile"><div class="v">1110</div><div class="l">段原文片段，代码核过都在原文里</div></div>
